{"2580310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SPACE DOGO", "steam_appid": 2580310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/b9546cafd44fc26c4aa4e8ff9430c496.poster.avif?t=1762449452\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/b9546cafd44fc26c4aa4e8ff9430c496.webm?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/b9546cafd44fc26c4aa4e8ff9430c496.mp4?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🚀 <strong>Get ready for the ultimate galactic adventure!</strong> <i>Space Dogo</i> is a <strong>2D run &amp; gun action-platformer</strong> starring <strong>Moro</strong>, a brave dog leading an elite canine squad. Her mission: <strong>rescue her owner and crew</strong> before a mysterious enemy wipes them out. Time is running out—lock and load!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/955a86abf8c7dd827ca11452a30c0509.poster.avif?t=1762449452\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/955a86abf8c7dd827ca11452a30c0509.webm?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/955a86abf8c7dd827ca11452a30c0509.mp4?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Shoot, dodge, and explore worlds packed with <strong>space mutants, traps, and hidden secrets</strong>. Find <strong>keys, mechanical parts</strong>, and pilot <strong>interstellar ships</strong> across <strong>five intense PvE story levels</strong>. Every stage is pure adrenaline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/900ce75e3ea8ffc18f62b78310435007.poster.avif?t=1762449452\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/900ce75e3ea8ffc18f62b78310435007.webm?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/900ce75e3ea8ffc18f62b78310435007.mp4?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Featuring <strong>vibrant visuals inspired by classic Japanese anime</strong> and an <strong>explosive, energetic soundtrack</strong>, <i>Space Dogo</i> bursts with <strong>retro charm, dynamic action, and humor</strong>. The <strong>cartoony proportions</strong>—big heads and hands—bring out each character’s expressive, over-the-top personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/cebfb1c039603a6674128249af16d5bd.poster.avif?t=1762449452\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/cebfb1c039603a6674128249af16d5bd.webm?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/cebfb1c039603a6674128249af16d5bd.mp4?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re not alone:</strong> once your ally bar is charged, you can <strong>summon a random canine teammate</strong> to back you up in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch your jet-pack fuel:</strong> always keep an eye on your <strong>fuel level</strong> to avoid getting stranded. Some enemies <strong>drop fuel tanks</strong>—grab them when you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay aware of your surroundings:</strong> every element in the environment <strong>can help you progress through the mission and uncover parts of the story</strong>. Stay sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss fights ahead:</strong> every boss <strong>commands smaller enemies</strong> ready to swarm you. <strong>Be cautious and plan your moves carefully.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Join Moro’s squad</strong>, save the galaxy, and prove that humankind’s best friend can also be the <strong>most badass hero in space!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/3fa188653bc78279e4bfbc2cf2f32774.avif?t=1762449452\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras_big/3fa188653bc78279e4bfbc2cf2f32774.webp?t=1762449452 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/b9546cafd44fc26c4aa4e8ff9430c496.poster.avif?t=1762449452\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/b9546cafd44fc26c4aa4e8ff9430c496.webm?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580310/extras/b9546cafd44fc26c4aa4e8ff9430c496.mp4?t=1762449452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🚀 <strong>Get ready